    <bpmn:process id="W_W1377" name="W1377. DIY Workshop Instructor Recruitment, Certification &amp; Training Content Management" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: New workshop topic identified by Marketing or Merchandising; or existing instructor annual recertification due; or instructor performance review identifies training gap
Frequency: 2–3 new instructor certifications/month; annual recertification for all active instructors
Volume: ~200–300 certified workshop instructors chain-wide (mix of Sales Associates trained as instructors and external guest experts); each store has 1–2 trained instructors
Owner: Training Manager (HQ HR)
Participants: Training Manager, Department Supervisor, Sales Associate (instructor candidate), Marketing (content), Category Manager (product expertise), external vendor trainer
Source: workflow W1377 — DIY Workshop Instructor Recruitment, Certification &amp; Training Content Management</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1377_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1377_Lane1" name="Marketing">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1377_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1377_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1377_Lane2" name="Training Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1377_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1377_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1377_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1377_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1377_Task12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1377_Task13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1377_Lane3" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1377_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1377_End14</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1377_Start5" name="New workshop topic identified by Marketing or Merchandising; or existing instructor…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1377_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1377_Task6" name="Marketing or Merchandising identifies new workshop topic based on: (a) seasonal…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Marketing or Merchandising identifies new workshop topic based on: (a) seasonal calendar (e.g., &quot;Waterproofing Basics&quot; before rainy season); (b) new product launch (e.g., &quot;Cordless Power Tool Workshop&quot; for new DeWalt line); (c) customer request trends from W608 CX feedback; (d) competitor gap analysis
Responsible (R): Marketing / Category Manager
Accountable (A): CMO
Duration: Ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1377_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1377_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1377_Task7" name="Training Manager develops workshop curriculum: (a) learning objectives (3–5…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Training Manager develops workshop curriculum: (a) learning objectives (3–5 specific skills attendees will learn); (b) step-by-step project guide (written in Filipino and English); (c) materials list with SKU references (items available at BuildRight); (d) instructor script with key talking points, safety reminders, and upsell suggestions; (e) hands-on practice component (minimum 60% of workshop time on hands-on activity); (f) estimated duration (2–3 hours standard); (g) attendee take-home materials (project guide, materials list, discount coupon for related products)
Responsible (R): Training Manager
Accountable (A): CMO
Duration: 2–3 days/topic</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1377_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1377_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1377_Task8" name="Training Manager identifies instructor candidates: (a) Sales Associates with…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Training Manager identifies instructor candidates: (a) Sales Associates with product expertise in the workshop topic (e.g., tile department Associates for tiling workshop); (b) Department Supervisors as senior instructors; (c) external guest experts (licensed electricians for electrical workshops, licensed plumbers for plumbing workshops — required for topics involving regulated trades); (d) preference for associates with good communication skills identified in performance reviews per W72
Responsible (R): Training Manager / Department Supervisor
Accountable (A): HR Head
Duration: 1 week</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1377_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1377_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1377_Task9" name="Instructor certification training: (a) Training Manager conducts 1-day…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Instructor certification training: (a) Training Manager conducts 1-day certification session (can be virtual via video conference for provincial stores); (b) covers: curriculum walkthrough, instructor techniques (demo pacing, attendee engagement, safety briefing), common attendee questions and answers, upsell techniques; (c) candidate delivers a 30-minute mock workshop segment observed by Training Manager; (d) Training Manager evaluates on: technical accuracy, presentation clarity, safety compliance, time management, and attendee engagement; (e) pass/fail: candidates must score ≥ 80% on evaluation rubric; (f) certified instructors recorded in system with topic-specific certification and expiry date
Responsible (R): Training Manager
Accountable (A): HR Head
Duration: 1 day/candidate</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1377_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1377_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1377_Task10" name="For topics involving regulated trades (electrical, plumbing): (a) external…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: For topics involving regulated trades (electrical, plumbing): (a) external guest instructor must hold valid Philippine Professional Regulation Commission (PRC) license; (b) Training Manager verifies license with PRC online database; (c) guest instructor co-leads workshop with certified Sales Associate (BuildRight staff handles sales/upsell, guest expert handles technical content)
Responsible (R): Training Manager
Accountable (A): VP Legal
Duration: 30 min/verification</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1377_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1377_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1377_Task11" name="System maintains instructor certification record: (a) instructor employee ID…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: System maintains instructor certification record: (a) instructor employee ID; (b) certified workshop topics with certification dates; (c) certification expiry (12 months); (d) workshops conducted (count, attendee ratings); (e) attendee satisfaction scores per workshop; (f) instructor flagged for recertification 30 days before expiry
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): Training Manager
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1377_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1377_Flow22</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1377_Task12" name="Annual recertification: (a) Training Manager reviews instructor&#x27;s 12-month…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 7: Annual recertification: (a) Training Manager reviews instructor&#x27;s 12-month performance (workshops conducted, attendee ratings, upsell conversion rate); (b) instructor attends half-day refresher covering curriculum updates and new products; (c) if attendee rating average &lt; 3.5/5.0: instructor placed on improvement plan (retraining + observed workshop); (d) if performance satisfactory: certification renewed for 12 months
Responsible (R): Training Manager
Accountable (A): HR Head
Duration: Half day/instructor</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1377_Flow23</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1377_Flow23</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1377_Task13" name="Quarterly: Training Manager reviews workshop content relevance: (a) are…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 8: Quarterly: Training Manager reviews workshop content relevance: (a) are workshop topics aligned with current promotional calendar and seasonal demand?; (b) are materials lists still accurate (SKU availability, pricing)?; (c) should any topics be retired (low attendance) or added (new trends)?; (d) content updated and redistributed to certified instructors
Responsible (R): Training Manager / Marketing
Accountable (A): CMO
Duration: 1 day/quarter</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1377_Flow24</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1377_End14" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1377_Flow25</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W1377_Annotation15">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-277 (ensure controlled execution — Workshops &amp; Events (PA-12.3).) | - operational: Training Manager (HQ HR) review and approval gate
Owner: Training Manager (HQ HR)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W1377_Assoc16" sourceRef="W1377_Annotation15" targetRef="W1377_Start5" associationDirection="None" />
