    <bpmn:process id="W_W1378" name="W1378. Customer DIY Workshop Registration, Waitlist Management &amp; Attendance Tracking" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Customer registers for DIY workshop via BuildRight mobile app, website, or in-store sign-up; or workshop capacity reached triggering waitlist
Frequency: ~2–3 workshops per store per month × 200 stores = ~400–600 workshops/month; ~15–25 registrations per workshop
Volume: ~6,000–15,000 workshop registrations/month chain-wide (400–600 workshops × 15–25 registrations)
Owner: Department Supervisor (store-level); Marketing (registration platform)
Participants: Customer, Department Supervisor, Sales Associate (instructor), Marketing, Loyalty Team
Source: workflow W1378 — Customer DIY Workshop Registration, Waitlist Management &amp; Attendance Tracking</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1378_LaneSet5">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1378_Lane1" name="Marketing">
